{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","森罗万象"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","삼라만상"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","生命值较低时回到布阵处扎根。主动释放时击飞目标及其周围敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","HP가 낮을 때는 배치 위치로 돌아가 뿌리를 박는다.\n액티브: 목표 및 그 주변 적을 에어본시킨다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥曼斯生命值比例首次低于30%时回到己方后排的空布阵格扎根并恢复30% + 2% HP生命值。扎根状态下，奥曼斯无法移动并处于霸体状态，普通攻击变为远程并对主目标周围1格范围内的其他敌人造成50%的伤害。主动释放时，选择一名敌人，击飞目标及其周围1格范围内的敌人并造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，同时附带4% HP伤害。优先选择攻击范围内敌人最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","울머스의 HP 비율이 처음으로 30% 미만이 되면 아군 후열 빈칸으로 돌아가 뿌리를 박으며 30% + 2% HP의 HP를 회복한다. 뿌리 박기 상태에서 울머스는 이동불가 및 제어 면역 상태가 된다. 또한 일반 공격이 원거리로 변경되고 메인 목표 주변 1칸 범위 내 다른 적에게 50%의 대미지를 입힌다. \n액티브: 적 1명을 선택하여 목표를 에어본시키고 그 주변 1칸 범위 내 적에게 200% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입히며, 동시에 4% HP의 대미지를 추가한다. 공격 범위 내 적이 가장 밀집된 구역을 우선 선택하여 시전한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":138,"end":144,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":219,"end":225,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":63,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":134,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":155,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":51,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":97,"end":102,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":215,"end":229,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":245,"end":250,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","액티브 시전 시, 입히는 대미지가 210% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","액티브 시전 시, 입히는 대미지가 220% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","액티브 시전 시, 입히는 대미지가 230% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","액티브 시전 시, 입히는 대미지가 240% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","深林庇护"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","숲의 가호"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自己添加护盾，护盾被击破时对周围敌人造成伤害。扎根后改为最靠前友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신에게 실드를 추가하며, 실드가 파괴되었을 때 주변 적에게 대미지를 입힌다. 뿌리를 박은 후 가장 앞에 있는 아군에게 실드를 추가하는 것으로 변경된다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥曼斯为自己添加25% + 3% HP的护盾持续10秒，当护盾被击破或消失时，对周围1格范围内的其他敌军造成160% + 15% ATK伤害。扎根状态下，改为使最靠前的友军获得该护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","울머스가 자신에게 25% + 3% HP의 실드를 10초간 추가한다. 실드가 파괴되거나 사라지면 주변 1칸 범위 내 다른 적군에게 160% + 15% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 뿌리 박기 상태에서 가장 앞에 있는 아군이 해당 실드를 획득하는 것으로 변경된다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":76,"end":82,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":80,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":10,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":72,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":109,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提升至28% + 3% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","실드 수치가 28% + 3% HP까지 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提升至32% + 3% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","실드 수치가 32% + 3% HP까지 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提升至35% + 3% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","실드 수치가 35% + 3% HP까지 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","生生不息"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","끝없는 성장"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","持续恢复生命值。扎根时改为恢复能量。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","HP를 지속적으로 회복한다. 뿌리 박기 시 에너지 회복으로 변경된다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，奥曼斯每秒恢复3.5% + 0.5%的已损失生命值。扎根状态下改为每秒恢复30 + 4点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","패시브: 울머스가 초당 손실된 HP의 3.5% + 0.5%를 회복한다. 뿌리를 박은 상태에서는 초당 에너지를 30 + 4 회복하는 것으로 변경된다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":43,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":25,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":63,"end":67,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至4% + 0.5%，能量恢复量提升至32 + 4点。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","HP 회복량이 4% + 0.5%로, 에너지 회복량이 32 + 4(으)로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":29,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":10,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至4.5% + 0.5%，能量恢复量提升至34 + 4点。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","HP 회복량이 4.5% + 0.5%로, 에너지 회복량이 34 + 4(으)로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":33,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至5% + 0.5%，能量恢复量提升至36 + 4点。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","HP 회복량이 5% + 0.5%로, 에너지 회복량이 36 + 4(으)로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":29,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":10,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身最大生命值。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 최대 HP가 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升17%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 최대 HP가 17% 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升23%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 최대 HP가 23% 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升29%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 최대 HP가 29% 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","根蔓御敌"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","뿌리 제압"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌方被击倒后延长其倒地时间，并对其造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","적군이 넘어진 후 쓰러진 시간이 연장되며 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥曼斯通过树根感知战场情况，当有敌人受到击飞、击倒或强制位移后，奥曼斯会用树根将目标捆倒在地，延长其2秒倒地时间，并造成80% ATK伤害，该效果对同一名敌人每10秒最多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","울머스는 나무뿌리로 전장 상황을 감지한다. 적이 에어본, 넘어지거나 강제 이동이 된 후 울머스는 나무뿌리를 이용해 목표를 묶어서 넘어뜨려 쓰러진 시간이 2초 연장되며 80% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 해당 효과는 동일한 적군에게 10초당 최대 1회 발동한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":93,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至100%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 100%로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该技能造成伤害时附带60点生命汲取效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","해당 스킬로 대미지를 입힐 때 60의 생명 흡수 효과가 추가된다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至120%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 120%로 증가한다."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“深林庇护”提供的护盾被击破时还会击退周围敌人。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","스킬 숲의 가호로 제공하는 실드가 파괴되면 주변 적을 넉백시킨다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“深林庇护”提供的护盾被击破或消失时，还会击退周围敌军1格。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","스킬 숲의 가호로 제공하는 실드가 파괴되거나 사라지면 주변 적군을 1칸 넉백시킨다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","古木新枝"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","고목 풋가지"]]}